integration.manage.description=Webhooks connect this workspace to other systems. Another system calls an incoming webhook to report what happened to an object - a push, a build, a deployment - and the automation rules on 'Event of another system' decide what follows. Rules call an outgoing webhook with the action 'webhook <name>'; every call is signed, retried and parked like any automation job.
